nd C2 100 nF (datasheet 3.5). R1 100 R in DATA at the mic: source termination\nfor the 150-200 mm W27 lead (datasheet 3.5: about 100 R)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 43.18 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a49b1ce2-aef7-5857-be70-096cbd79fd3f")) (text "LR strap, one design for four positions (D-066): fit R2 OR R3, never both.\nL variant (FRONT_L, REAR_L): R2 1k LR to GND, mic drives DATA after the falling clock edge.\nR variant (FRONT_R, REAR_R): R3 1k LR to +3V3, mic drives DATA after the rising clock edge.\n1k, not 0R, so a double fit cannot short the mic rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 43.18 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6115b4de-57ba-599d-8aa0-e81193f41d93")) (text "P1-P4: wire pads on the inner face for the W27 pre-crimped GH 4-way AWG28 lead (D-037), in GH pin order:\n1 +3V3, 2 CLK, 3 GND, 4 DATA. GND sits between CLK and DATA. PCB-05 J5-2..5 must use the same order.\nH1, H2: Ø2.2 holes for the M2 x 4 screws into the shell boss, ±5 mm from the port." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 43.18 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "19705f79-12ca-525c-affa-6d21c9b9737f")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
